<p><strong>Is non-AC really cheaper?</strong> By ₹2 per km. On a 600 km trip that is ₹1,200.</p>
<p><strong>How much luggage fits?</strong> About 17 bags, in the boot and on the roof carrier.</p>
<p><strong>Are the seats recliners?</strong> They are push-back seats, which tilt for comfort. For full recliners, see the <a href="/17-seater-urbania-for-rent-in-bangalore">17 seater Urbania</a>.</p>
